<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24798" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαθέω</span></b> , aor. 1
		part.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαθεύσας</span> Vett. Val.<i><span class="en">
			345.35
		</span></i>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>run about,
				run to and fro,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				8.92
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Mis.</u>
				338c
			</span></i>, etc.; of reports, <i>spread,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				20.3
			</span></i>; of a panic, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				6.2.13
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀστέρες διαθέοντες</span>
			<i>shooting</i> stars, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				342b21
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>run a race,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				148c
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span>
			<i>with</i> or <i>against . .,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Prt.</u>
				335e
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.58f
				</span></i>
			: c. acc. cogn., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τὴν λαμπάδα</span>
			<i>run</i> the torch-<i>race,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Sol.</u>
				1
			</span></i>.</div>
